            "type": "note",
            "text": "LibGONODES Example Patch — show.gnpatch\n\nUsed by the SDL, OpenGL, Vulkan, and Metal host examples.\n\nThe host injects an LFO into \"host_lfo\" (HostInCHOP)\nand reads the rendered texture from \"host_out\" (HostOutTOP).\n\nThe host drives noise1.time_offset via parameter API\nor uses the LFO channel to animate the noise.",
